ons and help you with any issues you may have.'=>'在 Bit Apps，我们为所有类型的客户提供各种产品支持，无论是免费用户还是专业用户。我们通过电子邮件和在线聊天积极提供支持。我们的支持团队随时准备帮助您。我们在这里回答您的问题并协助您解决任何问题。','Facebook support group'=>'Facebook 支持群组','YouTube channel'=>'YouTube 频道','Chat here'=>'在这里聊天','Rate us on WordPress'=>'在 WordPress 上评价我们','Lost In Space'=>'迷失太空','Redirecting Home in'=>'正在重定向到首页','Go Home'=>'回到首页','Warning'=>'警告','Are you sure you want to leave the form? Unsaved data will be lost.'=>'您确定要离开表单吗？未保存的数据将会丢失。','Are you sure you want to switch forms? Unsaved data will be lost.'=>'您确定要切换表单吗？未保存的数据将会丢失。','Switch Form'=>'切换表单','Are you sure to duplicate this entry?'=>'您确定要复制此条目吗？','View Repeater Data'=>'查看重复器数据','Entry Details #'=>'条目详情 #','Data Views & Edit'=>'数据视图与编辑','View Analytics Report'=>'查看分析报告','No Entry Found.'=>'未找到条目。','Form Settings'=>'表单设置','Conversational Form'=>'对话式表单','Landing Form'=>'着陆表单','WP Auth'=>'WordPress 认证','Entries are loading...'=>'条目加载中...','Advance Field Wise Report'=>'高级字段报告','Please select fields to view reports individually'=>'请选择字段以单独查看报告','Thank you for using Bit Form. If you like the plugin, please give us a'=>'感谢您使用 Bit Form。如果您喜欢该插件，请给我们一个','review'=>'评价','on WordPress.org to help us spread more.'=>'在 WordPress.org 上，帮助我们传播更多。','Filter Options'=>'筛选选项','All filters below will get entries based on analytics report'=>'以下所有筛选器将根据分析报告获取条目','Filter by Date'=>'按日期筛选','Entry Status'=>'条目状态','Select Fields for Report:'=>'选择报告字段：','Total Entry:'=>'条目总数：','Loading...'=>'加载中...','Printing...'=>'打印中...','Print Report'=>'打印报告','Welcome to Bit Form'=>'欢迎使用 Bit Form','Thank you for installing Bit Form.'=>'感谢您安装 Bit Form。','Modern Form builder and database management  system'=>'现代表单构建器和数据库管理系统','for Wordpress'=>'适用于 Wordpress','Create First Form'=>'创建第一个表单','Add More +'=>'添加更多 +','Country Field available in Pro version of Bit Form.'=>'国家字段在 Bit Form 专业版中可用。','You can use either ReCaptcha-V2 or ReCaptcha-V3 in a form. to use ReCaptcha-V2 disable the ReCaptcha-V3 from the Form Settings.