表单宽度修改','Field Clone'=>'字段克隆','Field Cloning'=>'字段克隆','Disable Entry Storing'=>'禁用条目存储','Capture Google Ads Click'=>'捕获 Google 广告点击','Login User'=>'登录用户','Empty Submission'=>'空提交','Allowed IP List'=>'允许的 IP 列表','Blocked IP'=>'被阻止的 IP','Blocked IP List'=>'被阻止的 IP 列表','Entry Limit'=>'条目限制','Single Entry for each IP'=>'每个 IP 仅允许一次提交','Form Entry Edit'=>'表单条目编辑','Honeypot trap'=>'蜜罐陷阱','Snackbar Message'=>'Snackbar 消息','Modal Message'=>'模态消息','Rating Message on Hover'=>'悬停时的评级消息','Rating Message on Select'=>'选择时的评级消息','PDF Template'=>'PDF 模板','Custom Theme Feature'=>'自定义主题功能','Advanced Conditional Logic'=>'高级条件逻辑','Name is the unique identifier for the field. It is used to reference the field in the form submission data.'=>'名称是字段的唯一标识符。它用于在表单提交数据中引用该字段。','Label is the title of the field that appears above or beside the field. You can show or hide the field label by toggling this option.'=>'标签是出现在字段上方或旁边的字段标题。您可以通过切换此选项显示或隐藏字段标签。','Autocomplete allows you to specify what type of automated assistance the browser should provide for filling out the field, <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Attributes/autocomplete\'>Learn more</a>'=>'自动完成允许您指定浏览器应为填写字段提供何种类型的自动化辅助，<a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Attributes/autocomplete\'>了解更多</a>','Admin Label is the title of the field that will be used as an alternative reference throughout the dashboard. You can toggle this option to use or disable the admin label.'=>'管理员标签是字段的标题，将作为整个仪表板中的替代引用。您可以切换此选项以使用或禁用管理员标签。','Subtitle is an optional description that appears under the Field Label. You can show or hide the field subtitle by toggling this option.'=>'副标题是可选描述，显示在字段标签下方。您可以通过切换此选项显示或隐藏字段副标题。','Helper Text is an optional text that appears beneath the field to provide additional information to the user. You can show or hide the helper text by toggling this option.'=>'辅助文本是可选文本，显示在字段下方，为用户提供额外信息。您可以通过切换此选项显示或隐藏辅助文本。','Default Value is the initial value that will appear in the field. You can show or hide the default value by toggling this option.'=>'默认值是字段中显示的初始值。您可以通过切换此选项显示或隐藏默认值。','Suggestions allows you to add a custom suggestion list that will display suggestions as the user types in the input field.'=>'建议允许您添加自定义建议列表，在用户输入时显示建议内容。','Placeholder is the text that appears inside the field before your user enters their own content. You can show or hide the field placeholder by toggling this option.'=>'占位符是在用户输入内容前显示在字段内的文本。您可以通过切换此选项显示或隐藏字段占位符。','This allows browser to display an appropriate virtual keyboard if needed. <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Global_attributes/inputmode\'>Learn more</a>'=>'这允许浏览器在需要时显示适当的虚拟键盘。<a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Global_attributes/inputmode\'>了解更多</a>','Input Mask allows you to specify a pattern for the input field, helping users enter data in the correct format.<a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://bit-form.com/wp-docs/form-fields/bit-form-input-mask/\'>Learn more</a>'=>'输入掩码允许您为输入字段指定格式模式，帮助用户以正确格式输入数据。<a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://bit-form.com/wp-docs/form-fields/bit-form-input-mask/\'>了解更多</a>','Set a regular expression pattern that the input value should match for the field.'=>'设置输入值应匹配的正则表达式模式。','This allows to make the field mandatory for users to fill out before submitting the form. You can toggle this option to use or disable the required.'=>'这允许将字段设为必填，用户必须填写后才能提交表单。您可以切换此选项以启用或禁用必填。','The hide field feature allows you to hide the field from the user on the form. You can toggle this option to show or hide the field.'=>'隐藏字段功能允许您在表单中隐藏该字段。您可以切换此选项以显示或隐藏字段。','The reverse button feature allows to reverse the clear and undo button. You can toggle this option to reverse clear and undo button.'=>'反转按钮功能允许反转清除和撤销按钮。您可以切换此选项以反转清除和撤销按钮功能。','Readonly feature allows you to set a field as read-only, meaning that users will not be able to edit the content of that field. You can toggle this option to enable or disable the setting.'=>'只读功能允许您将字段设置为只读，用户将无法编辑该字段的内容。您可以切换此选项以启用或禁用该设置。','Disabling a field prevents users from interacting with it or entering data. You can toggle this option to enable or disable the field as needed.'=>'禁用字段将阻止用户与其交互或输入数据。您可以根据需要切换此选项以启用或禁用字段。','Enabling this option will check from the submitted entries whether its value is duplicate.'=>'启用此选项将检查提交条目中该值是否重复。','Enabling this option will check from your WordPress user database whether its value is duplicate.'=>'启用此选项将检查您的 WordPress 用户数据库中该值是否重复。','Stripe provide a variety of themes for the payment form. You can choose the theme that best suits theme your payment form. <a target="_blank" href="https://stripe.com/docs/elements/appearance-api">Learn more</a>'=>'Stripe 提供多种支付表单主题，您可以选择最适合您的支付表单的主题。<a target="_blank" href="https://stripe.com/docs/elements/appearance-api">了解更多</a>','Stripe provide minimum or maximum amount for different payment method type and currency. <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://stripe.com/docs/currencies#minimum-and-maximum-charge-amounts\'>learn more</a>'=>'Stripe 为不同支付方式类型和货币提供最低或最高金额限制。<a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://stripe.com/docs/currencies#minimum-and-maximum-charge-amounts\'>了解更多</a>','Allows you to preset the language to be used in the hosted payment pages shown to the consumer. This option is Optional. <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://docs.mollie.com/reference/v2/payments-api/create-payment#:~:text=locale,OPTIONAL,-Allows%20you%20to\'>learn more</a>'=>'允许您预设托管支付页面向消费者显示的语言。此选项为可选。<a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://docs.mollie.com/reference/v2/payments-api/create-payment#:~:text=locale,OPTIONAL,-Allows%20you%20to\'>了解更多</a>','Mollie provide a description for the payment. This option is required. <a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://docs.mollie.com/reference/create-payment#:~:text=Body%20Params-,description,required,-The%20description%20of\'>learn more</a>. and also you add field value in this description. e.g: This Payment from Name: ${field_key}'=>'Mollie 需要为支付提供描述。此选项为必填。<a target=\'_blank\' href=\'https://docs.mollie.com/reference/create-payment#:~:text=Body%20Params-,description,required,-The%20description%20of\'>了解更多</a>。同时你也可以在此描述中添加字段值。例如：此付款来自姓名：${field_key}','You can add or remove Undo button form Signature Field. You can toggle this option to add or remove the Undo button.'=>'您可以添加或移除签名字段的撤销按钮。您可以切换此选项以添加或移除撤销按钮。','You can add or remove Clear button form Signature Field. You can toggle this option to add or remove the Clear button.'=>'您可以添加或移除签名字段的清除按钮。您可以切换此选项以添加或移除清除按钮。','This allows to show the rating message on hover. You can toggle this option to show or hide the rating message on hover.'=>'此选项允许在悬停时显示评分消息。您可以切换此选项以显示或隐藏悬停时的评分消息。','This allows to show the rating message on rating selected. You can toggle this option to show or hide the rating message on rating selected.'=>'此选项允许在选择评分时显示评分消息。您可以切换此选项以显示或隐藏选择评分时的评分消息。','By enabling this feature, you will enable to select multiple image.'=>'启用此功能后，您将能够选择多张图片。','By enabling this feature, you will be hide image label.'=>'启用此功能后，您将隐藏图片标签。','This allows to show the header icon. You can toggle this option to show or hide the header icon.'=>'此选项允许显示头部图标。您可以切换此选项以显示或隐藏头部图标。','This allows to show the stem button settings. You can toggle this option to show or hide the stem button settings.'=>'此选项允许显示干预按钮设置。您可以切换此选项以显示或隐藏干预按钮设置。','This allows to show the step label. You can toggle this option to show or hide the step label.'=>'此选项允许显示步骤标签。您可以切换此选项以显示或隐藏步骤标签。','This allows to show the step subtitle. You can toggle this option to show or hide the step subtitle.'=>'此选项允许显示步骤副标题。您可以切换此选项以显示或隐藏步骤副标题。','Container Class allows you to add custom CSS classes to the field container. You can use this to apply custom styles to the field wrapper.'=>'容器类允许您向字段容器添加自定义 CSS 类。您可以使用此功能为字段包装器应用自定义样式。','This option allows you to enable a confirm email field that requires users to re-enter their email address for verification.'=>'此选项允许您启用确认电子邮件字段，要求用户重新输入其电子邮件地址以进行验证。','This option allows you to enable a confirm password field that requires users to re-enter their password for verification.'=>'此选项允许您启用确认密码字段，要求用户重新输入其密码以进行验证。','This allows to show the password icon. You can toggle this option to show or hide the password icon.'=>'此选项允许显示密码图标。您可以切换此选项以显示或隐藏密码图标。','Allow only one entry for each IP address.'=>'每个 IP 地址只允许一次提交。','Allow only logged in users to submit the form.'=>'只允许已登录用户提交表单。','This will prevent empty form submission.'=>'这将防止空表单提交。','This will validate the field when the user leaves the field.'=>'当用户离开字段时，将对字段进行验证。','This will disable storing the user entry in the database.'=>'这将禁用将用户输入存储到数据库中。','This will enable reCAPTCHA v3.'=>'这将启用 reCAPTCHA v3。','This will limit the number of entries.'=>'这将限制提交次数。','this will limit the form submission for specific period.'=>'这将限制表单在特定时间段内的提交。','This will block the specific IP address from submitting the form.'=>'这将阻止特定的 IP 地址提交表单。','This will allow the specific IP address to submit the form.'=>'这将允许特定的 IP 地址提交表单。','This will enable Google Ads conversion tracking.'=>'这将启用 Google 广告转化跟踪。','How to Configure Confirmation Message/Redirect page'=>'如何配置确认消息/重定向页面','How to Configure Conditional Logic'=>'如何配置条件逻辑','How to enable Conversational Form'=>'如何启用会话表单','How to Setup Integrations'=>'如何设置集成','How to Configure Email Templates'=>'如何配置电子邮件模板','How to Setup ACF integration'=>'如何设置 ACF 集成','How to Setup ActiveCampaign integration'=>'如何设置 ActiveCampaign 集成','How to Setup Acumbamail integration'=>'如何设置 Acumbamail 集成','How to Setup Autonami integration'=>'如何设置 Autonami 集成','How to Setup Dropbox integration'=>'如何设置 Dropbox 集成','How to Setup Elastic Email Integration'=>'如何设置 Elastic Email 集成','How to Setup Encharge integration'=>'如何设置 Encharge 集成','How to Setup Fluent-CRM integration'=>'如何设置 Fluent-CRM 集成','How to Setup Google Sheets integration'=>'如何设置 Google Sheets 集成','How to Setup Integrately integration'=>'如何设置 Integrately 集成','How to Setup Integromat integration'=>'如何设置 Integromat 